@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - HotS Patch Notes</PageTitle>

<div class="about-page">
    <h1>About HotS Patch Notes</h1>
    
    <div class="card">
        <h2>What is this?</h2>
        <p>
            HotS Patch Notes is a community project that provides a comprehensive database 
            of Heroes of the Storm heroes, their abilities, talents, and patch history.
        </p>
        <p>
            This website is a modern rewrite of <a href="https://heroespatchnotes.com" target="_blank">heroespatchnotes.com</a>, 
            built with Blazor WebAssembly and ASP.NET Core.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Data Sources</h2>
        <p>All data is sourced from the heroespatchnotes GitHub organization:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <a href="https://github.com/heroespatchnotes/heroes-talents" target="_blank">heroes-talents</a> - 
                Hero abilities, talents, and icons in JSON format
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="https://github.com/heroespatchnotes/heroes-patch-data" target="_blank">heroes-patch-data</a> - 
                Patch version history
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Technology Stack</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> Blazor WebAssembly (.NET 10)</li>
            <li><strong>Backend:</strong> ASP.NET Core Web API</li>
            <li><strong>Database:</strong> SQLite with Entity Framework Core</li>
            <li><strong>Data Sync:</strong> Periodic synchronization from GitHub repositories</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
            This is a fan-made project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Blizzard Entertainment. 
            Heroes of the Storm, Blizzard Entertainment, and all related properties are trademarks 
            or registered trademarks of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
